{"id":"gospozha","lemma":"госпожа","pos":"noun","rank":686,"glosses":["madam, ma'am, Mrs., Miss (polite, formal term of address for a woman)","lady, mistress (the mistress of a household of servants or a manor)","mistress (term of address by a submissive partner to a dominant woman)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"госпожи","plural":"госпожи","masculine":"господин"},"examples":[{"text":"Сколько слуг хочет нанять та госпожа?","en":"How many maids does that lady want to employ?","words":[{"g":"how much, how many"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to hire, to engage"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null]},{"text":"Кто этот господин?","en":"Who is that gentleman?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"this/that one"},null]},{"text":"Тот господин, должно быть, доктор.","en":"That gentleman must be a doctor.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones"},null,{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"doctor"}]},{"text":"Это последний поезд, господин.","en":"This is the last train, sir.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"last, latest, recent"},{"g":"train"},null]},{"text":"В чём дело, господин?","en":"What's the matter, sir?","words":[null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,3,"what's up?"]]}]}